WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:20.981
Zippy drove toward the tree.

2
00:00:20.982 --> 00:00:25.232
He slammed on his brakes.

3
00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:27.876
But the racetrack was slippery.

4
00:00:27.877 --> 00:00:30.975
Zippy slid.

5
00:00:30.976 --> 00:00:34.045
He tried to turn.

6
00:00:34.046 --> 00:00:38.549
"Oh no!" cried Zippy.

7
00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:43.804
"I'm going to hit the—" Bam!

8
00:00:43.805 --> 00:00:53.897
Zippy's side banged into the tree.

9
00:00:53.898 --> 00:00:56.894
"Ouch!" said Zippy.

10
00:00:56.895 --> 00:00:59.884
"I got a bad dent."

11
00:00:59.885 --> 00:01:03.300
Eddy drove slowly.

12
00:01:03.301 --> 00:01:19.715
He went around the tree.

13
00:01:19.716 --> 00:01:23.219
He went past Zippy.

14
00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.645
"You were going too fast," said Eddy.

15
00:01:26.646 --> 00:01:32.667
Zippy frowned.

16
00:01:32.668 --> 00:01:36.812
Zoom! Zippy shot past Eddy.

17
00:01:36.813 --> 00:01:42.629
Water splashed on Eddy.

18
00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:47.210
Then Zippy hit a big puddle.

19
00:01:47.211 --> 00:01:50.007
He went left.

20
00:01:50.008 --> 00:01:52.713
He went right.

21
00:01:52.714 --> 00:01:55.646
Zippy spun in circles.

22
00:01:55.647 --> 00:01:58.921
"Whoa!" he cried.

23
00:01:58.922 --> 00:02:01.852
"Oh no!" said Eddy.

24
00:02:01.853 --> 00:02:04.721
He saw Zippy spin.

25
00:02:04.722 --> 00:02:15.625
Then Zippy flew off the track!
